<title>ITALY: Spread between Italian BTP and bund narrows.</title>
<headline>Spread between Italian BTP and bund narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between Italian BTP and the benchmark bund narrowed to a record 98 basis points in early trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tne spread has closed steadily in recent weeks as investors bet on Italy's increasing chances of joining European economic and monetary union (EMU) in the first wave.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
